    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Calculators </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Medicare levy</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Free calculator</p>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Medicare levy and surcharge calculator</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">The 2% levy, the low-income reduction that shades it in, and the surcharge you pay for not having hospital cover — all three in one place.</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft mt-4\"> Updated for 2024–25, 2025–26, 2026–27 · verified against <a href=\"https://www.ato.gov.au/tax-rates-and-codes/tax-rates-australian-residents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ato.gov.au</a> on 2026-08-21 · some 2026–27 thresholds are provisional pending ATO indexation </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"MedicareCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{&quot;defaultFy&quot;:&quot;2025-26&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Your taxable income</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_2l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"95,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">For the surcharge the ATO also counts reportable fringe benefits and salary-sacrificed super.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Financial year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\" selected=\"\">2025–26</option><option value=\"2026-27\">2026–27</option></select></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have a spouse</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Family thresholds are roughly double the single ones, tested on combined income.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_6l_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Dependent children</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"0\" selected=\"\">0</option><option value=\"1\">1</option><option value=\"2\">2</option><option value=\"3\">3</option><option value=\"4\">4</option><option value=\"5\">5</option></select></div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Each child lifts the low-income family threshold, and the second onwards lifts the surcharge threshold.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_al_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have private hospital cover</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Hospital cover, not extras. Extras-only policies do not exempt you from the surcharge.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_al_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_cl_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I am eligible for the seniors and pensioners offset</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Seniors get a higher low-income threshold before the levy applies.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_cl_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Medicare</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2025–26</span></div>\n<div class=\"tally-print\">\n<div data-tally-line=\"income\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Taxable income</span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$95,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"levy\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Medicare levy</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,900</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"surcharge\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Medicare levy surcharge</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$0</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"total\" class=\"px-4 py-5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Total Medicare cost</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Added to your income tax at assessment.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-owing)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,900</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">Total Medicare cost<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,900</span></p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not tax advice. Exemptions for certain visa holders, defence members and Norfolk Island residents are not modelled.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Total Medicare cost</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-owing)]\">$1,900</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p><!--astro:end--></div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"prose-statement\">\n<h2>The shading-in range nobody explains</h2>\n<p> Below <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$28,011</span> you pay no levy. Above  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$35,013</span> you pay the full 2%. In between, the levy phases in at 10c for each dollar over the threshold — which works out at an effective marginal rate of 10% on that band, on top of your income tax. </p>\n<p> That is the highest effective marginal rate most low earners will ever face, and it sits at exactly the income where people take on extra shifts. Worth knowing about; not worth turning down work over. </p>\n<h2>The surcharge arithmetic</h2>\n<p> Above <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$101,000</span> as a single, you pay 1% of your entire income as surcharge if you have no hospital cover — rising to 1.5% at the top tier. On <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$150,000</span> that is <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-owing text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,875</span> a year for nothing. A basic hospital policy is usually less, and unlike the surcharge it buys you something. </p>\n<p> Two details catch people. The surcharge is worked out on income for surcharge purposes, which adds back reportable fringe benefits and salary-sacrificed super. And it is charged for the days you were without cover, so taking out a policy mid-year reduces it proportionally rather than wiping it. </p>\n<h2>Families</h2>\n<p> Family thresholds are roughly double the single ones and are tested on combined income, so a couple earning <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$95,000</span> each pay no surcharge while a single person on  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$190,000</span> pays it at the top rate. Each dependent child after the first lifts the family threshold by <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,500</span>. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-medicare-levy-calculator-heading\">\n<h2 id=\"faq-medicare-levy-calculator-heading\" class=\"text-2xl\">Questions people actually ask</h2>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">How much is the Medicare levy?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">2% of your taxable income. If your income is at or below <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$28,011</span> you pay none; between that and about <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$35,013</span> it shades in gradually rather than jumping straight to the full amount.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">What is the difference between the levy and the surcharge?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">The levy is 2% and almost everyone pays it. The surcharge is an extra 1% to 1.5% charged only to higher earners who do not hold private hospital cover. The surcharge exists to push people into private cover, and for most people above the threshold a basic policy costs less than the surcharge.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Does extras cover exempt me from the surcharge?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">No. Only hospital cover with an excess at or below the ATO limit exempts you. Extras-only policies — dental, optical, physio — do not, and people are caught by this every year.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Can I be exempt from the Medicare levy?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes, in limited circumstances: certain foreign residents, some visa holders from countries without a reciprocal agreement, blind pensioners and some defence force members. You need a Medicare entitlement statement to claim most exemptions.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Do tax offsets reduce the Medicare levy?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">No. The low income tax offset and the seniors and pensioners offset reduce income tax only. The levy is calculated separately and offsets never touch it — which is why someone can pay no income tax and still pay the levy.</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Read up first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/tax-tips/how-to-lodge-a-tax-return/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\">How to lodge your tax return</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">The three ways to lodge an Australian tax return, what you need before you start, when to wait for pre-fill, and how the agent deadline extension works.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-dark\">\n<div class=\"cta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p>\n<h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2>\n<p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/services/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec\">\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Registered tax agent</span><b>26233684</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee taken from your refund</span><b>$44</b></div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Other calculators</h2>\n<p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">All calculators →</a> </div>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Income tax </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Your tax, Medicare levy, study loan repayment and take-home pay for any income, in any of the last three financial years.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-refund-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Tax refund </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/calculators/capital-gains-tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Capital gains </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">What you will pay on a share, property or crypto sale — with the 50% discount and any carried-forward losses applied in the right order.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/MedicareCalculator.js\" defer></script></p>\n"
